<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Swift Energy cut to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Swift Energy cut to buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>FAC Equities said it downgraded Swift Energy Co to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Cited 43 percent rebound in shares since April 15. Said expected shares to rise another 30 percent by year's end.</p>
<p>-- Said company is entering a period of difficult year-over-year comparisons.  Said expects eventual rise in energy prices, with seasonal rise in demand, to drive the stock to $36 per share or nine times 1997 cash flow estimate by year's end.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1-5/8 to 26-1/8.</p>
</text>
